# Build context for Dockerfile.sandbox only.
#
# BuildKit reads <dockerfile>.dockerignore in preference to .dockerignore, so
# this keeps the sandbox build lean WITHOUT changing the context of the
# production `Dockerfile` — that build is not this change's business.
#
# Measured effect: ~200 MB of context down to ~1 MB. Dockerfile.sandbox COPYs
# only package.json, package-lock.json and .npmrc, so nothing here is needed.
# node_modules in particular is a macOS/arm64 tree that would be wrong inside a
# Linux image even if it were copied.

*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!.npmrc
